                                                "sense_id": "e3d398ba-0cf1-3516-b70a-c74ab50fa88d",
                                                "text": "Later on, all the tinned meat came to an end, likewise the potatoes, and we lived on salt meat, biscuit, and duff; this fare was served out to all the messes on board, and we, I was going to say, saloon-folk, fared no better than the fo'castle hands."
                                            }
